{
 "tickets": [
  {
   "body": "Hi, some of our patients are telling us they aren't getting their text and email booking notifications, and we aren't sure how to change the wording or schedule for those messages either. Can you help us figure out where those settings are?",
   "id": "gen-381",
   "subject": "Questions about text reminders and delivery"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hello support, I noticed this morning that my lab results feed seems to have stopped updating. I checked the connection settings in the diagnostic module, but everything looks correct on my end. Could someone take a look at our interface to see why incoming feeds are missing today?",
   "id": "gen-382",
   "subject": "Missing lab feed connection"
  },
  {
   "body": "Good morning. Several patients have asked us to update their preferred pharmacy choices because their old locations have closed down. When I try searching the built-in directory for the new independent neighborhood pharmacies, they do not appear in the search results. Could you please let me know how we can manually enter a custom pharmacy into the system so we can save it to patient profiles correctly?",
   "id": "gen-383",
   "subject": "Adding custom pharmacies to the directory"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hello, I am trying to get our data backup schedule set up properly and review our compliance archive settings for the year. I went into the settings menu under administration, but I am quite lost regarding how to establish the proper backup frequency and how we are supposed to pull historical data exports when needed. Could you please provide some guidance or documentation on how to configure these archival features correctly?",
   "id": "gen-384",
   "subject": "Help with data backup schedules and compliance settings"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hi team, a patient's usual pharmacy changed its address and name. I can't find the new location in the directory search. How do I add a custom pharmacy entry manually?",
   "id": "gen-385",
   "subject": "Pharmacy search and custom entry"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hello, I am reviewing incoming diagnostic results this week and wanted to make sure I am following the best workflow for signing off and annotating them. Specifically, I would like to know the proper steps for routing abnormal values to a covering physician when I am out of the office, as well as how to attach specific clinical notes before filing everything into the patient chart.",
   "id": "gen-386",
   "subject": "Reviewing and annotating incoming lab results"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hi there, sorry to bother you with this, but we are trying to set up online booking for our patients and got a bit turned around. Could you help us figure out how to restrict certain web-portal booking types so patients can only select specific routine visits and providers?",
   "id": "gen-387",
   "subject": "Question about online appointment booking restrictions"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hello, I recently received an alert that one of our commonly prescribed medications is out of stock at local pharmacies. Could you remind me of the steps to handle substitution messaging and switch the prescription to an alternative therapeutic agent within the patient chart?",
   "id": "gen-388",
   "subject": "Medication out of stock alerts and substitutions"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hello, could you point us to the reporting tools we can use to track our recent insurance claim denials and see our denial trends over the last few months?",
   "id": "gen-389",
   "subject": "Tracking and reporting on denied claims"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hi, I am trying to figure out how our user roles and permissions are set up because some staff members can see financial screens they shouldn't access. I looked under the user management tab, but I'm completely lost on how to adjust permission levels or build custom security roles. Could someone walk me through how to audit and update these access levels?",
   "id": "gen-390",
   "subject": "Confused about user roles and permission levels"
  }
 ]
}
